    {
      "text": "Toss 340 g flank steak, sliced against the grain 5 mm thick with 1/4 tsp baking soda and 1 tbsp water (for the marinade) until absorbed, then with 1 tsp soy sauce (for the marinade), 1 tsp Shaoxing wine and 2 tsp cornstarch (for the marinade). Stir in 1 tsp neutral oil (for the marinade) and marinate 20 minutes.",
